  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Energized Body</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Sebastian-shaw.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120912045511\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sebastian-shaw\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Sebastian-shaw.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20120912045511\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Sebastian-shaw.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20120912045511 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/9/96/Sebastian-shaw.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20120912045511 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Sebastian-shaw\" width=\"270\" height=\"111\" data-image-key=\"Sebastian-shaw.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Sebastian-shaw.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Sebastian Shaw (X-Men First Class) is able to stay young because of his ability to absorb energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Be enhanced by energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div> \n<p>The power to <b>absorb energy to improve the bodily functions</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Energetic_Physical_Augmentation\" title=\"Energetic Physical Augmentation\">Energetic Physical Augmentation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications_(Basis)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications (Basis)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Applications_(Levels)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications (Levels)</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Peak\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Peak</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Enhanced\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enhanced</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Supernatural\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Supernatural</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Ultimate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ultimate</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Energizing</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User can enhance themselves through absorbing energy and converting it into bodily energy to perform superhuman feats. They can absorb any form of energy and will be granted improved functions and abilities, depending on the type and amount of energy absorbed.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Applications_.28Basis.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications_(Basis)\">Applications (Basis)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Ambient Energy Absorption\">Ambient Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Empowerment\" title=\"Energy Empowerment\">Energy Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Metabolization\" title=\"Energy Metabolization\">Energy Metabolization</a></li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Applications_.28Levels.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications_(Levels)\">Applications (Levels)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Peak\">Peak</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Development\" title=\"Adaptive Development\">Adaptive Development</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Efficient_Body\" title=\"Efficient Body\">Efficient Body</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maximum_Muscle_Usage\" title=\"Maximum Muscle Usage\">Maximum Muscle Usage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Optimal_Finesse\" title=\"Optimal Finesse\">Optimal Finesse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy_Amplification\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Energy Amplification\">Personal Energy Amplification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition\" title=\"Peak Human Condition\">Peak Human Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body\" title=\"Peak Human Body\">Peak Human Body</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Enhanced\">Enhanced</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Accelerated_Muscle_Development\" title=\"Accelerated Muscle Development\">Accelerated Muscle Development</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Contaminant_Immunity\" title=\"Contaminant Immunity\">Contaminant Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Transmutation\" title=\"Digestive Transmutation\">Digestive Transmutation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">Enhanced Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Enhanced\">Enhanced Body</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Muscle_Usage\" title=\"Enhanced Muscle Usage\">Enhanced Muscle Usage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Flawless_Coordination\" title=\"Flawless Coordination\">Flawless Coordination</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Supernatural\">Supernatural</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Brain_Augmentation\" title=\"Brain Augmentation\">Brain Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Change_Inducement\" title=\"Change Inducement\">Change Inducement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Beauty/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Beauty/Supernatural\">Supernatural Beauty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Bodily_Aspects\" title=\"Supernatural Bodily Aspects\">Supernatural Bodily Aspects</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Genetics\" title=\"Supernatural Genetics\">Supernatural Genetics</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Traits\" title=\"Supernatural Traits\">Supernatural Traits</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Supernatural\">Supernatural Body</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Regeneration/Supernatural\" title=\"Regeneration/Supernatural\">Supernatural Regeneration</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Generation\" title=\"Talent Generation\">Talent Generation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Bestowal\" title=\"Skill Bestowal\">Skill Bestowal</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ultimate\">Ultimate</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Body/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Body/Absolute\">Absolute Body</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Regeneration/Absolute\" title=\"Regeneration/Absolute\">Absolute Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Immortality/Absolute\" title=\"Immortality/Absolute\">Absolute Immortality</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Boundary_Removal\" title=\"Boundary Removal\">Boundary Removal</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Invincibility\" title=\"Absolute Invincibility\">Absolute Invincibility</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Endless_Development\" title=\"Endless Development\">Endless Development</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Immutability\" title=\"Immutability\">Immutability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Output_Manipulation\" title=\"Output Manipulation\">Output Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Charging_Manipulation\" title=\"Charging Manipulation\">Charging Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supertasking\" title=\"Supertasking\">Supertasking</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energizing\" title=\"Cosmic Energizing\">Cosmic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Energizing\" title=\"Stellar Energizing\">Stellar Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energizing\" title=\"Solar Energizing\">Solar Energizing</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Energizing\" title=\"Electromagnetic Energizing\">Electromagnetic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Energizing\" title=\"Electric Energizing\">Electric Energizing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Energizing\" title=\"Light Energizing\">Light Energizing</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a> on the available energy in body</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Energizing\" title=\"Heat Energizing\">Heat Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermic_Energizing\" title=\"Thermic Energizing\">Thermic Energizing</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Energizing\" title=\"Ionic Energizing\">Ionic Energizing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinetic_Energizing\" title=\"Kinetic Energizing\">Kinetic Energizing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Energizing\" title=\"Quantum Energizing\">Quantum Energizing</a></li>\n<li>Limited <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a> via manipulating available energy in body. Adaptability causes energy capacity to increase</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Radioactive_Energizing\" title=\"Radioactive Energizing\">Radioactive Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Energizing\" title=\"Gamma Energizing\">Gamma Energizing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Energizing\" title=\"Wave Energizing\">Wave Energizing</a></li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D10&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cultivation\" title=\"Cultivation\">Cultivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Longevity/Supernatural\" title=\"Longevity/Supernatural\">Supernatural Longevity</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D11&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May need to keep absorbing energy over periods of time to maintain biological stability.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEnergized_Body%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D12&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Nathaniel Adam/Captain Atom (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Amy Allen/Bombshell (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Michael Carter/Waverider (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Daxamites (<i>DC Comics</i>); via yellow sun radiation</li>\n<li>Kryptonians (<i>DC Comics</i>); via yellow sun radiation</li>\n<li>Clifford Zmeck/Major Force (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Majeston Zelia (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Bishop\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ma